ensemble_conservative is the first iteration using the first pass of best models (EXP-017, EXP-020)

ensemble2 is using the new iteration of models

ensemble2_opt was the absolute best profit factor config, but had very low trades volume, great win rate but not high pnl.

ensemble2_alt is using new models but with optuna tuned/searched hyperparameters. Much higher pnl than ensemble_opt.

Plan:

ensemble3 will be the new model using new features and an improvvement on ensemble2_alt
